  "notes": [
    "Spelling-change verb: c→qu before e (Pretérito yo: *marqué*; Subjuntivo: *marque/marques/marque/marquemos/marquen*)",
    "Past participle: marcado (regular)",
    "*Marcar un gol* = to score a goal; *marcar un número* = to dial a number",
    "*Marcar a alguien* = to leave a mark on someone (emotionally): *Esos olores te marcan para toda la vida* = Those smells mark you for life",
    "Related: la marca (mark, brand), marcado (marked, pronounced), el marcador (scoreboard, marker)"
  ],
